# Scene1-2-10

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐2-10
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:23_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『ゲストハウス』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进<br>紧挨着监牢的招待所里。|#0102Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚进来，她就遇到了可可和玛格。|#0102Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，你好啊艾玛。|#0102Adv10_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，你好！|#0102Adv10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（玛格又是设计热气球，又是帮忙筹集布料，<br>　真佩服她这么能干）|#0102Adv10_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:然后艾玛的目光<br>转到可可身上。|#0102Adv10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可可她还是阴晴不定的老样子，<br>　只会突然给别人泼冷水……）|#0102Adv10_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然她一直在办直播，<br>　但观众越来越少，越来越被孤立）|#0102Adv10_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要是还陪她玩的米莉亚<br>　哪天不在了，<br>　天知道她会变成什么样……）|#0102Adv10_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:今天，可可缠着玛格<br>吵个不停。|#0102Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，跟我一起直播嘛。<br>你的模仿特技绝对能爆红的。<br>来试试模仿动画配音嘛～|#0102Adv10_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，<br>我只能模仿听过的声音。|#0102Adv10_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我几乎不看电视，<br>没办法模仿名人的声音。|#0102Adv10_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不过蕾雅和诺亚都算是名人吧。<br>她们的声音我有听过，<br>这个我倒是可以模仿。|#0102Adv10_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不是那个意思啦～！|#0102Adv10_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格敷衍地回给她一个笑容，<br>便扭头看向艾玛。|#0102Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你今天也是在找亚里沙吧。<br>她没来过这里。|#0102Adv10_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，玛格。<br>你们在这里做什么？|#0102Adv10_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算飞过了围墙，我们也不知道<br>还要移动多长距离才算安全，不是吗？|#0102Adv10_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我准备把应急食物和必需的物资<br>先藏在这里。|#0102Adv10_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果这附近有村落还好说……<br>但这里是孤岛，我们还需要渡海。<br>那我们就要准备周全才行，你说对不对？|#0102Adv10_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是哦……|#0102Adv10_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦，也不用表现得那么难过。<br>现在我们先以飞过围墙为目标吧。|#0102Adv10_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之后的事情，到时候再考虑就好。<br>船到桥头自然直啦。|#0102Adv10_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（有玛格帮我们<br>　真是太好了……）|#0102Adv10_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看到艾玛对玛格投以崇拜的目光，<br>可可咂了咂嘴，表示不屑。|#0102Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～，真是无聊死了～。<br>找大叔玩去咯。|#0102Adv10_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可故意提高音量，<br>丢下这句话后就走了。|#0102Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只剩艾玛和玛格两人面面相觑。|#0102Adv10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:我是不是打扰到你们了……？|#0102Adv10_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可应该是想找人陪她玩吧。|#0102Adv10_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:听说最近米莉亚经常陪她玩。|#0102Adv10_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。虽然会给米莉亚增添负担，<br>但她确实是最适合的人选。|#0102Adv10_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我也觉得……最近把米莉亚当作心灵支柱的人<br>　越来越多了）|#0102Adv10_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛稍微帮玛格处理了些工作后，<br>便离开了招待所。|#0102Adv10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

